  "title": "Pebbled leather material with creases",
  "purpose": "Build a leather node material from one Voronoi pattern read twice: distance to the cell edge for sunken creases and distance to the centre for domed pebbles, with darker rougher creases, tone noise and a light sheen. Use it for bags, shoes, seats, belts and book covers.",
