  "limits": "An even pebble grain only; no stitching, wrinkles from use, scratches or pore detail. Object coordinates tie the grain size to the object's scale, so scaled objects need a matching grain scale. The bump is subtle at a distance. Rendered here with Cycles CPU only. Verified in Blender 5.2.1; written for the 4.2 API.",
